    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00120",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“真可怜啊。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "How pitiful.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00120",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "头痛好了，可以在你家待到十二点了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Now that my headache is gone, I can stay at your house until twelve.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00120",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "就是白天，两个小时不来，他也都哭着过日子。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Even in the daytime, if I do not come for two hours, he spends the time crying.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00120",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "于是我就每隔一小时来一趟。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "So I come once every hour.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
